    sth:smart_tool_holder_scan_failure_handling_method "If no available tool holder is displayed after LOAD STHSCAN, confirm that the tool holder has entered Idle Mode and check Networking (TCP/IP settings), MessageBroking (MQTT settings), IP address 10.0.0.103, and subnet mask 255.255.255.0."@en .

