    sth:answer "Before using MQTT, add an inbound rule in Windows Defender Firewall to allow TCP Port 1883 communication so that the computer can enable the MQTT service."@en ;
    sth:corresponding_topic sth:MQTT,
        sth:initial_operation ;
    sth:default_communication_port "1883" ;
    sth:mqtt_communication_setting_method "Add an inbound rule in Windows Defender Firewall, select Port, configure TCP and specific local port 1883, and select Allow the connection."@en ;
    sth:mqtt_firewall_settings "Add an inbound rule allowing TCP Port 1883."@en ;
    sth:question "How do I allow MQTT Port 1883 communication?"@en,
        "How do I configure MQTT communication in Windows Defender Firewall?"@en,
        "How do I configure MQTT communication?"@en,
        "How do I configure communication before using MQTT?"@en,
        "What firewall settings are required before using MQTT?"@en .

