sth:power_consumption_analysis a sth:analysis ;
    rdfs:label "Power Consumption Analysis"@en ;
    sth:conclusion "The recommended continuous use time for the Smart Tool Holder is less than 7 hours."@en ;
    sth:description "Power Consumption Analysis. Execution time: 5/11 21:27–5/12 06:05 and 5/11 03:33–5/11 12:15, 2025. Conditions: spindle speed 0 rpm; maximum voltage 4.08, 4.11 V; minimum voltage 2.68, 2.67 V; duration 510, 525 min. Description: the Smart Tool Holder operates on a lithium battery and includes low-battery protection to prevent over-discharge and reduced battery life. This analysis uses continuous Smart Tool Holder communication to determine the maximum usable time under the built-in battery protection. Results: the maximum continuous use time reaches 8 hours 30 minutes. The recommended continuous use time is less than 7 hours."@en ;
    sth:maximum_use_time "Testing shows that the maximum continuous use time of the Smart Tool Holder can reach 8 hours 30 minutes."@en ;
    sth:recommended_continuous_use_time "The recommended continuous use time for the Smart Tool Holder is less than 7 hours."@en ;
    sth:result "Testing shows that the maximum continuous use time of the Smart Tool Holder can reach 8 hours 30 minutes."@en .

