    sth:charging_dock_output_voltage_specification "DC 12V"@en ;
    sth:charging_dock_solid_green_led_answer "A solid green LED means fully charged."@en ;
    sth:charging_dock_solid_red_led_answer "A solid red LED means charging."@en ;
    sth:charging_precautions "When charging, make sure the adapter is firmly inserted into the charger Adapter position and confirm that the charging dock clamping direction is correct."@en ;
    sth:description "Charging Module. The LED indications are shown in Table 3, Smart Tool Holder Charging Dock LEDs. When charging, make sure the adapter is firmly inserted as shown in Figure 5, Charger Adapter Position, and use the clamping direction shown in Figure 6, Charging Dock Clamping Method. Table 3, Smart Tool Holder Charging Dock LEDs: Status / Green / Red. Not charging: - / -. Charging: - / On. Fully charged: On / -. Figure 5, Charger Adapter Position, V1 on the left and V2 on the right. Figure 6, Charging Dock Clamping Method. Item Specifications: Operating Temperature 0°C–50°C; Storage Temperature -10°C–60°C; Input Voltage DC 12V; Max. Input Current 2A; Max. Charging Current 2A; Charging CC mode 2A; Charging CV mode MAX 8.5V; Adapter Input Specifications Vac 100V–240V, 50/60Hz, 0.5A; Adapter Output Specifications DC 12V; Max. Charging Time 2 hr; Battery life - Activity ≥ 6 hr; Battery life - Standby ≥ 10 days; Charging state-LED: uncharged off / red on while charging / green on when fully charged."@en ;
    sth:has_led_mapping sth:charging_base_green_led_on,
        sth:charging_base_red_led_on ;
